        # 2. Fused Operation: AvgPool(4x4x4) + BatchNorm
        # Two layers of AvgPool3d(kernel_size=2) are mathematically equivalent to AvgPool3d(kernel_size=4, stride=4).
        # We fuse this pooling with Batch Normalization.
